<h1>Certifications</h1>

<p>Meridian Castings holds the following management system certificates, issued and audited by accredited third-party bodies. Copies of current certificates are available to customers and suppliers on request through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

<table class="table">
    <thead>
        <tr><th>Certificate</th><th>Sites covered</th><th>Last renewed</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>ISO 9001:2015</td><td>Sheffield, Wrexham, Poznan</td><td>March 2025</td></tr>
        <tr><td>IATF 16949:2016</td><td>Sheffield, Wrexham</td><td>June 2025</td></tr>
        <tr><td>AS9100D</td><td>Sheffield</td><td>September 2024</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ISO 14001:2015</td><td>Sheffield, Wrexham, Poznan</td><td>March 2025</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<p>Certification audits are carried out annually, with a full re-certification audit every three years. Our most recent site-wide renewal is described in our <a href="/history">company history</a>. Suppliers working to these standards on our behalf should refer to our <a href="/suppliers/terms">terms of supply</a>.</p>
